{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-exo-34-1","title":"Exodus 34:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The tables are renewed. 5 The name of the LORD proclaimed. 8 Moses entreats God to go with them. 10 God makes a covenant with them, repeating certain duties of the first table. 28 Moses, after forty days in the mount, comes down with the tables. 29 His face shines, and he covers it with a vail.</p>\n<p>Hew. 31:18; 32:16,19; De 10:1 I will. 28; De 10:1-4 the words. Ps 119:89 which. 32:19; De 9:15-17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-34-2","title":"Exodus 34:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>in the top. 19:20,24; 24:12; De 9:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-34-3","title":"Exodus 34:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>19:12,13,21; Le 16:17; 1Ti 2:5; Heb 12:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-34-5","title":"Exodus 34:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>descended. 19:18; 33:9; Nu 11:17,25; 1Ki 8:10-12; Lu 9:34,35 the name. 33:19; Nu 14:17; De 32:3; Ps 102:21; Pr 18:10; Isa 1:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-34-6","title":"Exodus 34:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>passed. 33:20-23; 1Ki 19:11 proclaimed. Nu 14:17-19; Isa 12:4 The Lord. 3:13-16 merciful. De 5:10; 2Ch 30:9; Ne 9:17; Ps 86:5,15; 103:8-13; 111:4; 112:4 Ps 116:5; 145:8; Joe 2:13; Jon 4:2; Ro 2:4 abundant. Ps 31:19; Mic 7:18; Ro 2:4; 5:20,21; Eph 1:7,8 truth. Ps 57:10; 91:4; 108:4; 111:8; 138:2; 146:6; La 3:23; Mic 7:20 Joh 1:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-34-7","title":"Exodus 34:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>Keeping. 20:6; De 5:10; Ne 1:5; 9:32; Ps 86:15; Jer 32:18; Da 9:4 forgiving. Ps 103:3; 130:4; Da 9:9; Mic 7:18; Mt 6:14,15; 12:31; 18:32-35 Lu 7:42,48; Ac 5:31; 13:38; Ro 4:7,8; Eph 1:7; 4:32; 1Jo 1:9 that will by no means clear the guilty.The Hebrew {nakkeh lo yenakkeh,} has been rendered \"Acquitting him who is not innocent.\" Nothing can more strongly express the goodness of God to frail mortals than this declaration, \"which has been misunderstood and misinterpreted by all our translators.\"</p>\n<p>23:7,21; Nu 14:18-23; De 32:35; Jos 24:19; Job 10:14; Ps 9:16,17 Ps 11:5,6; 58:10,11; 136:10,15; Isa 45:21; Mic 6:11; Na 1:2,3,6 Ro 2:4-9; 3:19-26; 9:22,23; Heb 12:29; Re 20:15; 21:8 visiting. 20:5,6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-34-8","title":"Exodus 34:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>4:31; Ge 17:3; 2Ch 20:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-34-9","title":"Exodus 34:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>If now. 33:13,17 let my Lord. 33:14-16; Mt 28:20 stiff-necked. 32:9; 33:3-5; Isa 48:4 pardon. Nu 14:19; Ps 25:11 take us. 19:5; De 32:9; Ps 28:9; 33:12; 78:62; 94:14; 135:4; Jer 10:16 Zec 2:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-34-10","title":"Exodus 34:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>I make. 24:7,8; De 4:13; 5:2,3; 29:12-14 I will do marvels. De 4:32-37; 32:30; Jos 6:20; 10:12,13; 2Sa 7:23; Ps 77:14; 78:12 Ps 147:20 a terrible. De 10:21; Ps 65:5; 66:3,5; 68:35; 76:12; 106:22; 145:6; Isa 64:3 Jer 32:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-34-11","title":"Exodus 34:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>Observe. De 4:1,2,40; 5:32; 6:3,25; 12:28,32; 28:1; Mt 28:20; Joh 14:21 I drive. 3:8,17; 33:2; Ge 15:18-21; De 7:1,19; 9:4,5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-34-12","title":"Exodus 34:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>Take heed. 23:32,33; De 7:2; Jud 2:2 lest. De 7:16; Jos 23:12,13; Jud 2:3; 8:27; Ps 106:36</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-34-13","title":"Exodus 34:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>ye shall. 23:24; De 7:5,25,26; 12:2,3; Jud 2:2; 6:25; 2Ki 18:4; 23:14 2Ch 31:1; 34:3,4 images. Heb. statutes.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-34-14","title":"Exodus 34:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>worship. 20:3-5; De 5:7; Mt 4:10 whose. 5-7; 33:19; Isa 9:6; 57:15 jealous God. 20:5; De 5:24; 6:15; 29:20; 32:16,21; Jos 24:19; Na 1:2; 1Co 10:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-34-15","title":"Exodus 34:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>make. 10,12; 23:32; De 7:2 whoring. Le 17:7; 20:5,6; Nu 15:39; De 31:16; Jud 2:17; Ps 73:27; Jer 3:9 Ezr 6:9; Ho 4:12; 9:1; Re 17:1-5 call thee. Nu 25:2; 1Co 10:27 eat. Ps 106:28; 1Co 8:4,7,10; 10:20,21; Re 2:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-34-16","title":"Exodus 34:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>Nu 25:1,2; De 7:3,4; 1Ki 11:2-4; Ezr 9:2; Ne 13:23,25; 2Co 6:14-17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-34-17","title":"Exodus 34:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>32:8; Le 19:4; Isa 46:6,7; Jer 10:14; Ac 17:29; 19:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-34-18","title":"Exodus 34:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>12:15-20; 13:4,6,7; 23:15; Le 23:6; De 16:1-4; Mr 14:1; Lu 22:1 Ac 12:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-34-19","title":"Exodus 34:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>openeth. 13:2,12; 22:29; Nu 18:15-17; Eze 44:30; Lu 2:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-34-20","title":"Exodus 34:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>firstling. 13:10; Nu 18:15 lamb. or, kid. All the. 13:15; Nu 3:45-51 none. 23:15; De 16:16; 1Sa 9:7,8; 2Sa 24:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-34-21","title":"Exodus 34:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>Six. 20:9-11; 23:12; 35:2; De 5:12-15; Lu 13:14; 23:56 earing. Ge 45:6; De 21:4; 1Sa 8:12; Isa 30:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-34-22","title":"Exodus 34:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>feast of weeks. 23:16; Nu 28:16-31; 29:12-39; De 16:10-15; Joh 7:2; Ac 2:1 year's end. Heb. revolution of the year.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-34-23","title":"Exodus 34:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>Thrice. 23:14,17; De 16:16; Ps 84:7 the God. Ge 32:28; 33:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-34-24","title":"Exodus 34:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>I will. 11; 23:27-30; 33:2; Le 18:24; De 7:1; Ps 78:55; 80:8 enlarge. 23:31; De 12:20; 19:8; 1Ch 4:10 desire. Ge 35:5; 2Ch 17:10; Job 1:10; Pr 16:7; Ac 18:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-34-25","title":"Exodus 34:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>leaven. 12:20; 23:18; De 16:3; 1Co 5:7,8 be left. 12:10; 23:18; 29:34; Le 7:15; Nu 9:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-34-26","title":"Exodus 34:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>first. 23:19; De 26:2,10; Pr 3:9,10; Mt 6:33; 1Co 15:20; Jas 1:18 seethe. 23:19; De 14:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-34-27","title":"Exodus 34:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>Write. 17:14; 24:4,7; De 31:9 I have. 10; De 4:13; 31:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-34-28","title":"Exodus 34:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>forty days. 24:18; De 9:9,18,25 he wrote. 1; 31:18; 32:16; De 4:13; 10:2-4; 2Co 3:7 commandments. Heb. words.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-34-29","title":"Exodus 34:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>A.M. 2513. B.C. 1491. An. Ex. Is. 1. Elul. Two tables. 32:15 wist. 16:15; Jos 2:4; 8:14; Jud 16:20; Mr 9:6; 14:40; Lu 2:49; Joh 5:13 Ac 12:9; 23:5 the skin. Mt 17:2; Lu 9:29; Ac 6:15; 2Co 3:7-9,13; Re 1:16; 10:1 face shone.As the original word {karan,} signifies to shine out, or dart forth, as horns on the head of an animal, or rays of light reflected from a polished surface, we may suppose that the heavenly glory which filled the soul of this holy man, darted out from his face in coruscations, in the manner in which light is generally represented. The Vulgate renders it, {et ignorabat quod cornuta esset facies sua,} \"and he did not know that his face was horned;\" which version, misunderstood, has induced painters to represent Moses with two very large horns, one proceeding from each temple!</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-34-30","title":"Exodus 34:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>afraid. Nu 12:8; Mr 9:3,15; Lu 5:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-34-31","title":"Exodus 34:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>called. 3:15; 24:1-3 and Moses talked. Ge 45:3,15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-34-32","title":"Exodus 34:32","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":32,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":32},"content":"<p>he gave. 21:1; Nu 15:40; 1Ki 22:14; Mt 28:20; 1Co 11:23; 15:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-34-33","title":"Exodus 34:33","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":33,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":33},"content":"<p>a vail. Ro 10:4; 2Co 3:13-18; 4:4-6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-34-34","title":"Exodus 34:34","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":34,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":34},"content":"<p>he took. 2Co 3:16; Heb 4:16; 10:19-22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-exo-34-35","title":"Exodus 34:35","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EXO","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":35,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":35},"content":"<p>29,30; Ec 8:1; Da 12:3; Mt 5:16; 13:43; Joh 5:35; Php 2:15</p>"}]}